# Normalize to LF on commit. The skill is written and tested with LF;
# write_txt() emits LF explicitly so output files are identical across platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=lf

# cleanup_opencli_groups.ps1 must keep its UTF-8 BOM (PowerShell 5.1 decodes
# BOM-less UTF-8 as ANSI and fails to parse the Chinese comments).
# Line-ending normalization does not strip the BOM; this file is kept as text
# so diffs stay readable. The Python side also self-heals a missing BOM at
# runtime via vt_common._ensure_utf8_bom(), so a stripped BOM cannot break it.
